WEBVTT

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:32.615
The kei-ra cannon is ready to fire.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.743
Beginning countdown.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:39.497
Ten, nine, eight, seven...

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:43.084
six, five, four...

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:45.420
three, two...

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.671
one.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.506
Fire!

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:06.941
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:10.528
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:18.244
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.833
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:27.170
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:33.927
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:37.055
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:01:37.055 --> 00:01:40.475
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:47.273
<i>I don't believe anything I can</i>
<i>obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:53.405
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:01:53.405 --> 00:02:00.662
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:02:00.995 --> 00:02:05.375
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:08.837
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:02:08.837 --> 00:02:14.884
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:18.555
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:22.058
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:02:22.058 --> 00:02:23.560
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:28.773
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.862
Confirming a direct hit with the kei-ra cannon!

00:02:33.862 --> 00:02:36.156
Hurry up and get confirmation
on that contaminoid.

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.700
--Scattered burn-related injuries reported.
--No damage to the kei-ra cannon.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:39.784
We may fire again.

00:02:39.784 --> 00:02:41.411
Confirming.

00:02:44.372 --> 00:02:45.540
Did we do it?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.875
Confirming biosigns...

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:48.501
--No way it could be alive.
--It was a direct hit!

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.337
Sure enough.

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:57.761
I've confirmed life readings
from the contaminoid.

00:02:57.761 --> 00:02:58.970
What was that?

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.056
But it's a little strange.

00:03:01.056 --> 00:03:03.850
There is some "static" mixed
in with the sound of its heart.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.436
It couldn't be... <i>two </i>heartbeats?

00:03:06.436 --> 00:03:08.605
What does that mean?!

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:14.778
Our attack only caused the
contaminoid to divide into two?

00:03:14.778 --> 00:03:18.615
Did you hear, Vanzeh-<i>kun</i>?
That thing will come back to life.

00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:19.991
And there will be two.

00:03:19.991 --> 00:03:21.409
What?!

00:03:21.409 --> 00:03:25.955
Prepare the kei-ra cannon.
How long will it take to recharge?

00:03:25.955 --> 00:03:30.502
To round up a new group
of military artists? At least two hours.

00:03:30.502 --> 00:03:32.754
Wouldn't it be better
to dispatch some platoons

00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:35.090
and finish that thing off before then?

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:37.300
Glendan's presence bothers me.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.302
It's too early to send out the platoons.

00:03:39.302 --> 00:03:40.595
I see.

00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:42.597
The leg-section elevator has reached ground level.

00:03:42.597 --> 00:03:44.599
The door will now open.

00:03:46.393 --> 00:03:48.937
Nina Antalk has exited the city.

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:52.190
And now for the main issue...

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.944
Zuellni is currently motionless.
The reason is unknown.

00:03:55.944 --> 00:03:58.738
At this rate, the contaminoid will revive

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:01.157
and the city will again be placed in danger.

00:04:01.157 --> 00:04:05.370
Before the kei-ra cannon fires,
I want you to retrieve Nina Antalk,

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.122
who has left the city.

00:04:07.122 --> 00:04:11.001
Nina's presence is required
to make the city move.

00:04:11.001 --> 00:04:13.878
What do you plan to do
to Nina once we've found her?

00:04:13.878 --> 00:04:18.258
The Fallen One within
her must be removed at once.

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:21.511
Otherwise, Zuellni will continue to run amok.

00:04:21.511 --> 00:04:25.390
But if it is forcibly removed,
she'll just end up like Dinn!

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:28.351
The city's safety is our top priority.

00:04:28.351 --> 00:04:30.687
If the Fallen One cannot be removed,

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:34.649
Zuellni must be driven
from Nina Antalk's body.

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:37.652
You're saying we should kill her?

00:04:37.652 --> 00:04:42.574
You have two hours.
You must carry out your duty

00:04:42.574 --> 00:04:44.951
and return her to the city by then.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.870
If you exceed your allotted time,

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:50.999
Zuellni will again fire the kei-ra
cannon upon the contaminoid...

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:54.002
...no matter where outside the city you may be.

00:04:54.002 --> 00:04:56.963
We're about to see if we lose a city.

00:04:56.963 --> 00:05:00.759
As president, he's got no other choice!

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:03.053
Stop it, Sharnid!

00:05:03.053 --> 00:05:05.472
That's what he's saying.

00:05:07.849 --> 00:05:11.227
"Ignacius's Fragments"

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:16.483
Just when I thought I could see him,
he was split right in two.

00:05:16.483 --> 00:05:19.569
This is just what they wanted, isn't it?

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:22.489
Your Majesty, a message from Delboneh.

00:05:22.489 --> 00:05:23.865
Tell me.

00:05:23.865 --> 00:05:28.161
It says, "Someone is plotting to
infiltrate the Inner Palace."

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:32.165
At a time like this?
The seal has not been broken, correct?

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.584
Yes, ma'am. The entrance is blocked by a maze,

00:05:34.584 --> 00:05:37.045
and approach is thought impossible.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.799
Send Barmeleen.

00:05:40.799 --> 00:05:41.549
Ma'am.

00:05:41.549 --> 00:05:42.592
--I'm goin' first.
--Recon squadron to the elevator. I repeat...

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:44.636
--Okay, sorry.
--Recon squadron to the elevator. I repeat...

00:05:44.636 --> 00:05:47.263
--Recon squadron to the elevator.
--Shoot. Of all things...

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:52.852
Sorry 'bout that.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:58.775
I forgot something in Glendan.
But I'll take good care of your bike.

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:05.448
Huh? Why me?

00:06:05.448 --> 00:06:09.577
Shithead of a queen! Shit, shit shit!

00:06:10.829 --> 00:06:12.372
That stinks!

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:13.581
Shit!

00:06:13.581 --> 00:06:16.042
Shit, shit, shit!

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:19.170
So you're the shithead intruder, huh?

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.423
C'mon, now. You're way too vulgar.

00:06:21.423 --> 00:06:24.926
Shut up! Just die, shithead!

00:06:24.926 --> 00:06:27.053
I figured you were sure to come.

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.638
Your presence...

00:06:28.638 --> 00:06:33.768
You yourself are a conduit
connecting our world and this one.

00:06:33.768 --> 00:06:38.023
Your simply being here
makes many others become involved.

00:06:38.023 --> 00:06:39.232
It drags them in.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:41.651
It is hard to live in this world, yes?

00:06:41.651 --> 00:06:43.570
Just come back.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:48.700
You all destroyed my city.
You killed my father, my brother...

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.994
You killed everyone.

00:06:50.994 --> 00:06:54.789
Those I wanted to kill, those I trusted,

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:58.043
those I didn't care about... everyone!

00:06:58.043 --> 00:07:00.837
Restoration!

00:07:00.837 --> 00:07:04.966
That's what it means to steal
something from Dickserio Muscaine.

00:07:04.966 --> 00:07:07.761
I'm going to pound that fact into you!

00:07:10.889 --> 00:07:13.600
What, he thinks we're done?

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.604
Don't screw with me. Now I'm really pissed off!

00:07:17.604 --> 00:07:18.605
Your enemies are over there!

00:07:18.605 --> 00:07:22.192
I don't care if they're
enemies or allies! Die, shitheads!

00:07:22.192 --> 00:07:25.236
Die, shitheads! Die, shitheads!

00:07:25.236 --> 00:07:27.864
That mouth is <i>way </i>too foul.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.494
The Wolfmask Mob.

00:07:32.494 --> 00:07:34.496
Wolfmask Mob?

00:07:35.705 --> 00:07:37.749
An intruder, at a time like this?

00:07:37.749 --> 00:07:40.919
Precisely <i>because </i>it is
a time like this, perhaps.

00:07:40.919 --> 00:07:45.131
Have six Heaven's Blades remain in Glendan.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:48.343
I leave the contaminoid to you, Lintens.

00:07:48.343 --> 00:07:50.762
I shall retire to the Inner Palace.

00:07:50.762 --> 00:07:52.722
Have you done your math?

00:07:52.722 --> 00:07:55.809
If you take six, that leaves me with less than half.

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:59.938
Oh? Women don't like
men who are sticklers for math.

00:08:02.107 --> 00:08:04.526
You can stay behind, Siena.

00:08:04.526 --> 00:08:07.445
It was just the 17th that
was ordered to mobilize.

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:10.407
And if we botch this, we're gonna die.

00:08:10.407 --> 00:08:12.409
Do you really mean that?

00:08:14.244 --> 00:08:17.956
Have I ever lied to you?

00:08:17.956 --> 00:08:21.835
I've heard nothing <i>but </i>lies from that mouth.

00:08:21.835 --> 00:08:26.798
When can I finally hear
the truth come from it, Sharnid?

00:08:28.967 --> 00:08:33.388
I am a member of the 17th Platoon
as well. Don't forget that.

00:08:33.388 --> 00:08:34.806
Yeah.

00:08:38.601 --> 00:08:41.438
I will head directly for the contaminoid.

00:08:41.438 --> 00:08:44.899
You two spread out and look for our leader, please.

00:08:44.899 --> 00:08:45.775
Understood.

00:08:45.775 --> 00:08:46.985
Okay!

00:08:46.985 --> 00:08:48.528
Please wait.

00:08:48.528 --> 00:08:50.030
I'm coming, too.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:51.740
My range will be limited,

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:54.325
but I should be able to use my nen'i terminal.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.165
What is that?

00:09:01.082 --> 00:09:03.335
A call from Commander Hardy.

00:09:03.335 --> 00:09:04.294
What is it?

00:09:04.294 --> 00:09:07.339
What's going on? A platoon has just sortied!

00:09:07.339 --> 00:09:09.299
A recon squad bound for the contaminoid.

00:09:09.299 --> 00:09:12.552
I sent the 17th Platoon. They'll return shortly.

00:09:12.552 --> 00:09:14.596
Oh. Well, that's all right then.

00:09:14.596 --> 00:09:17.932
There will be no changes
to the kei-ra cannon's fire time.

00:09:17.932 --> 00:09:21.102
Understood. Things are going well on our end.

00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:23.480
Your voice sounds a little tired.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:27.942
Should personal growth be cause
for celebration, or should it not?

00:09:27.942 --> 00:09:28.985
What's going on?

00:09:28.985 --> 00:09:32.489
Just talking to myself. I'm hanging up.

00:09:32.489 --> 00:09:36.326
Why even go? The kei-ra cannon has just fired.

00:09:36.326 --> 00:09:40.038
There will be too much interference
for you to use your nen'i terminal.

00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:41.831
You'll only get in the way.

00:09:41.831 --> 00:09:44.417
The 17th Platoon was ordered to mobilize.

00:09:44.417 --> 00:09:46.836
It's only natural that I go as well.

00:09:46.836 --> 00:09:50.465
You've done enough. You need to get some rest.

00:09:50.465 --> 00:09:52.801
No. I shall not rest.

00:09:52.801 --> 00:09:56.513
Felli... Please listen to me, just this once.

00:09:56.513 --> 00:10:00.392
The order to fire the kei-ra
cannon cannot be belayed.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:02.894
If you'll excuse me.

00:10:02.894 --> 00:10:04.521
Wait there!

00:10:07.065 --> 00:10:08.900
Deactivate your nen'i terminal!

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:09.859
Otherwise...

00:10:09.859 --> 00:10:11.861
Stop! Lower your guns.

00:10:13.822 --> 00:10:15.907
Do you mean this, Felli?

00:10:15.907 --> 00:10:21.287
Yes. If I do not return in time,
please fire the kei-ra cannon.

00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:25.125
If we wish to protect the city,
there is no other way.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.839
Dude, come on, man!

00:10:33.091 --> 00:10:36.928
<i>I was far too ignorant back then.</i>

00:10:39.472 --> 00:10:43.309
<i>Though he was always by my side like that...</i>

00:10:43.309 --> 00:10:45.103
<i>Huh? Isn't that burned?</i>

00:10:45.103 --> 00:10:47.272
<i>Hey! I'm doing it right!</i>

00:10:47.272 --> 00:10:49.357
<i>Still, it smells good.</i>

00:10:49.357 --> 00:10:53.278
<i>Layfon's smile after he'd come</i>
<i>back from a fight set me at ease.</i>

00:10:53.278 --> 00:10:58.199
<i>I didn't try to learn a</i>
<i>single one of the burdens he bore...</i>

00:10:58.199 --> 00:10:59.951
So this is where you've been.

00:10:59.951 --> 00:11:03.329
You need to eat to keep your strength up.

00:11:03.329 --> 00:11:04.748
Thank you.

00:11:05.707 --> 00:11:06.666
I saw it!

00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:08.460
What's it like outside?

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.628
Zuellni's legs have stopped moving.

00:11:10.628 --> 00:11:12.464
Zuellni's stopped going rogue?

00:11:12.464 --> 00:11:15.800
Thank goodness! If we can manage
to escape from the contaminoid...

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.594
We might've just lucked out!

00:11:17.594 --> 00:11:19.512
Sorry, but with conditions as they are,

00:11:19.512 --> 00:11:22.932
I'd like you to keep unconfirmed
information to yourself.

00:11:22.932 --> 00:11:24.809
It will only cause confusion.

00:11:24.809 --> 00:11:29.397
Uh, that's not what I meant to do.
But now there's no need to worry!

00:11:29.397 --> 00:11:33.151
The 17th Platoon's been
sent out to kill the contaminoid!

00:11:33.151 --> 00:11:34.319
Layfon and the others?

00:11:34.319 --> 00:11:35.945
Ooh, how cool!

00:11:38.865 --> 00:11:41.076
The 17th Platoon?

00:11:41.076 --> 00:11:42.118
I have to go!

00:11:42.118 --> 00:11:42.786
Go where?

00:11:42.786 --> 00:11:44.371
I have to get this to Layfon.

00:11:44.371 --> 00:11:46.164
What are you talking about?

00:11:46.164 --> 00:11:49.209
Layfon's headed for the contaminoid.
Following him is impossible!

00:11:49.209 --> 00:11:52.337
But I have to give this to him <i>now</i>!

00:11:52.337 --> 00:11:57.300
Leerin... I'm sure that's
important to Layfon, isn't it?

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:02.180
I'd like to take you there myself,
if only I had that kind of power.

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:05.016
But this isn't Glendan.

00:12:05.016 --> 00:12:09.062
No one could take you straight
toward a contaminoid...

00:12:09.062 --> 00:12:11.731
Not here in Zuellni.

00:12:11.731 --> 00:12:13.191
What about Gorneo-<i>san</i>?

00:12:13.191 --> 00:12:15.443
Where is Gorneo Lueckens?

00:12:15.443 --> 00:12:17.904
Shit, shit, shit, shit!

00:12:24.494 --> 00:12:26.663
You know, I've been wanting to ask you...

00:12:26.663 --> 00:12:29.082
You sure that's a Heaven's Blade?

00:12:30.333 --> 00:12:33.128
Okay, smart guy! Die, you shits!

00:12:34.963 --> 00:12:36.548
Have you eliminated them?

00:12:36.548 --> 00:12:39.092
No, I've got a feeling I haven't.

00:12:39.092 --> 00:12:41.970
Her Majesty is sending more
Heaven's Blades to the labyrinth.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:44.681
I just hope they can stop them there.

00:12:55.483 --> 00:12:56.901
Again?

00:12:57.235 --> 00:13:01.322
The Regios shall disappear,
and the will of Rigsario turn to dust.

00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:05.452
Now is the time when Ignacius's
dreams shall become reality.

00:13:05.452 --> 00:13:11.041
Dainsleif, the emissary from the
Aurora Field, shall make it possible.

00:13:11.041 --> 00:13:15.337
We shall drag forth the sleeping
child that defies Ignacius

00:13:15.337 --> 00:13:17.339
and expose its identity.

00:13:24.929 --> 00:13:28.975
You can see the contaminoid
Dainsleif, can't you?

00:13:28.975 --> 00:13:33.480
Saya, are you asleep? Or...

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:39.319
What are you thinking right now?
Are you protecting Leerin?

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:43.865
Who gave you leave to enter here?

00:13:43.865 --> 00:13:48.995
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.
But time was of the essence.

00:13:48.995 --> 00:13:51.581
Why are you not in Zuellni?

00:13:51.581 --> 00:13:56.336
As per Your Majesty's command,
I saw Leerin-<i>sama </i>safely there.

00:13:56.336 --> 00:13:58.880
Now, I have come for my Heaven's Blade

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.841
so that I may deliver you
the Fallen One, Your Majesty.

00:14:01.841 --> 00:14:04.260
For a Heaven's Blade, defeat is unforgivable.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.846
I am different from Layfon.

00:14:08.515 --> 00:14:12.602
Layfon is not yet defeated.

00:14:13.812 --> 00:14:15.814
If you'll excuse me.

00:14:36.918 --> 00:14:38.962
Ma'am!

00:14:38.962 --> 00:14:41.756
Stay back. Do not touch me.

00:14:41.756 --> 00:14:47.721
Why? What are you trying
to make me do? Restoration.

00:14:47.721 --> 00:14:48.763
Ma'am...

00:14:48.763 --> 00:14:50.682
Do not stand in my way!

00:14:50.682 --> 00:14:52.308
Restoration!

00:15:08.783 --> 00:15:12.454
What do I do? I can't attack her full force...

00:15:13.329 --> 00:15:15.790
Do not stand in my way.

00:15:19.544 --> 00:15:21.713
Do not stand in my...

00:15:44.861 --> 00:15:48.239
Are you all right, ma'am?!

00:15:48.239 --> 00:15:50.241
You should have contacted
us as soon as you found her.

00:15:50.241 --> 00:15:51.368
I'm sorry.

00:15:51.368 --> 00:15:53.870
The contaminoids have begun moving.

00:15:55.205 --> 00:15:57.582
They are not yet completely revived,

00:15:57.582 --> 00:15:59.334
but once they're finished,
they'll catch up with you in no time.

00:15:59.334 --> 00:16:00.627
Understood.

00:16:00.627 --> 00:16:03.213
I'm going to take our leader out of here.

00:16:03.213 --> 00:16:06.299
Please bear 3:00 toward the rendezvous point.

00:16:06.299 --> 00:16:07.884
Our platoon leader has been found.

00:16:07.884 --> 00:16:09.594
We are heading for the rendezvous point.

00:16:09.594 --> 00:16:11.221
Roger that.

00:16:18.311 --> 00:16:22.732
Layfon... What should I do?

00:16:22.732 --> 00:16:25.318
Just hang in there, ma'am!

00:16:25.318 --> 00:16:32.992
I've prayed to grow stronger
to protect those important to me.

00:16:34.244 --> 00:16:40.166
I want to be stronger...
I've thought that for so long.

00:16:40.166 --> 00:16:41.292
Yes...

00:16:41.292 --> 00:16:46.673
It's Zuellni's will to protect
this city, and that will is <i>me</i>.

00:16:46.673 --> 00:16:49.217
I know that.

00:16:49.217 --> 00:16:54.472
What will happen to me so
long as this Fallen One is in me?

00:16:54.472 --> 00:16:58.184
Truthfully, the thought scares me.

00:16:59.853 --> 00:17:02.564
Ma'am, may I tell you something?

00:17:02.564 --> 00:17:03.940
What is it?

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:07.277
This whole time, I've rejected fighting.

00:17:07.277 --> 00:17:11.239
Though rejecting it, I've been in the 17th Platoon.

00:17:11.239 --> 00:17:11.948
Yes...

00:17:11.948 --> 00:17:17.120
But, it may be that I <i>haven't </i>rejected fighting.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.997
It's about atonement.

00:17:18.997 --> 00:17:20.123
Atonement?

00:17:20.123 --> 00:17:24.794
Atonement for Derk, the man who
raised me and who was my teacher.

00:17:24.794 --> 00:17:28.715
I acquired money through
underground tournaments.

00:17:28.715 --> 00:17:32.052
For that act of betrayal toward Derk,

00:17:32.052 --> 00:17:35.096
I forbade myself from
using Saiharden-style techniques

00:17:35.096 --> 00:17:38.350
and single-edged blades.

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:42.270
But during that fight earlier,
the desire to hold that blade,

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:46.733
to use those techniques rose up inside me.

00:17:46.733 --> 00:17:50.111
I have yet to atone for my sin.

00:17:50.111 --> 00:17:55.700
I have yet to be forgiven for
betraying everyone, making them sad.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.870
Yet once again, I...

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.497
Layfon...

00:18:00.497 --> 00:18:03.458
Don't leave the reason you fight to a weapon.

00:18:03.458 --> 00:18:10.048
No... Don't make wanting to fight
about anything other than yourself.

00:18:10.048 --> 00:18:14.594
That feeling has to spring up from within you.

00:18:14.594 --> 00:18:17.263
The same goes for your objective in fighting.

00:18:17.263 --> 00:18:21.768
You don't fight just because
someone else is fighting.

00:18:21.768 --> 00:18:25.271
Place yourself among people
with the same objective,

00:18:25.271 --> 00:18:29.859
then decide, assist, and finally take action.

00:18:29.859 --> 00:18:33.571
That's the best way, I think.

00:18:33.571 --> 00:18:36.658
But I've made mistakes, too.

00:18:36.658 --> 00:18:40.704
I got you wrapped up in this
without confirming how you feel.

00:18:40.704 --> 00:18:43.623
I don't feel you got me "wrapped up" in anything.

00:18:43.623 --> 00:18:48.628
I forcibly dragged you into the
17th Platoon, against your wishes.

00:18:49.879 --> 00:18:53.550
I'm here now because I choose to be.

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:57.971
More importantly, please stop
talking as if you're going to die.

00:18:57.971 --> 00:18:59.889
You're so powerful...

00:18:59.889 --> 00:19:02.267
<i>You're </i>saying that, ma'am?

00:19:02.267 --> 00:19:06.312
Sorry, I'm a little tired. Please let me rest.

00:19:06.312 --> 00:19:09.024
All right. I understand.

00:19:30.211 --> 00:19:33.715
So the Heaven's Blades have
arrived over there, eh?

00:19:33.715 --> 00:19:35.633
Well then, I...

00:19:36.593 --> 00:19:39.637
I'll settle my own business, shall I?

00:19:40.597 --> 00:19:42.307
I'm counting on you.

00:19:42.307 --> 00:19:44.184
You're really okay bein' left here?

00:19:44.184 --> 00:19:47.062
I'll figure something out if I'm on my own.

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:50.690
I have to slow down the
contaminoids, if even a little.

00:19:55.111 --> 00:19:56.863
Fon-Fon.

00:19:56.863 --> 00:20:01.076
Be mindful of the kei-ra cannon.
Its fire time cannot be changed.

00:20:01.076 --> 00:20:03.370
Thank you, Felli.

00:20:08.041 --> 00:20:11.670
Please make sure you come back. Idiot.

00:20:14.422 --> 00:20:16.383
I'll make sure I come back!

00:20:18.426 --> 00:20:21.554
The contaminoids have resumed activity.

00:20:21.554 --> 00:20:24.641
Moving to Threat Level B.

00:20:24.641 --> 00:20:25.850
--I repeat. The contaminoids have resumed activity.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:29.270
--All hands, return to your posts! We're at Level B!
--I repeat. The contaminoids have resumed activity.

00:20:35.735 --> 00:20:38.363
The contaminoids have begun to move!

00:20:38.363 --> 00:20:41.991
There's a chance the train may
stop before we reach the exterior edge.

00:20:47.622 --> 00:20:49.249
Restoration!

00:21:02.721 --> 00:21:04.347
Restoration!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:12.814
What is it?

00:21:12.814 --> 00:21:14.816
We were attacked.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.829
Fon-Fon, our leader's been kidnapped.

00:21:27.829 --> 00:21:28.329
Huh?

00:21:28.329 --> 00:21:32.334
He had a Heaven's Blade...
He was a Keeper of the Heaven's Blade!

00:21:38.298 --> 00:21:48.350
<i>Hello, who are you thinking of?</i>

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:55.440
<i>This letter still lies within my breast</i>

00:21:55.440 --> 00:22:05.492
<i>That fragment of memories</i>
<i>of you, suddenly encountered,</i>

00:22:05.492 --> 00:22:12.582
<i>has pierced my heart and I can't move</i>

00:22:12.582 --> 00:22:17.462
<i>I want you to notice, don't notice</i>

00:22:17.462 --> 00:22:21.132
<i>Do you treat me coldly because of love?</i>

00:22:21.132 --> 00:22:30.767
<i>I want to tell you "Be by my side," </i>
<i>but I can't say it</i>

00:22:31.518 --> 00:22:40.110
<i>It was in this filthy world</i>
<i>that I was able to meet you</i>

00:22:40.110 --> 00:22:51.287
<i>Please play this miracle</i>
<i>that has descended to my heart</i>

00:22:51.287 --> 00:22:59.295
<i>Zuellni my love</i>

00:23:07.887 --> 00:23:10.932
The 5th Platoon will remain on standby.

00:23:10.932 --> 00:23:12.350
Sir!

00:23:16.521 --> 00:23:18.857
You're Gorneo Lueckens-<i>san</i>, aren't you?

00:23:18.857 --> 00:23:19.858
Who are you?

00:23:19.858 --> 00:23:24.571
Leerin Marfes. I was in the
same orphanage as Layfon.

00:23:24.571 --> 00:23:25.989
Gor!

00:23:26.948 --> 00:23:30.827
I've come to ask of you...

00:23:30.827 --> 00:23:32.245
This...

00:23:32.245 --> 00:23:35.832
I want to get this to Layfon!

00:23:35.832 --> 00:23:38.835
That's... a Saiharden blade?

00:23:40.295 --> 00:23:41.629
Please...

00:23:41.629 --> 00:23:45.550
Please take me to the contaminoids!

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:57.479
<i>A man who controls a Fallen One.</i>
<i>A Sleeping Beauty within a maze.</i>

00:23:57.479 --> 00:23:59.397
<i>The location of the 12th Heaven's Blade.</i>

00:23:59.397 --> 00:24:01.232
<i>The girl whose eyes hold the moon.</i>

00:24:01.232 --> 00:24:04.444
<i>When all these come together,</i>
<i>the Regios shall move once again.</i>

00:24:04.444 --> 00:24:06.321
<i>Next time, "The Stirring Cities," and...</i>

00:24:06.321 --> 00:24:08.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
